Cb0Q3YcHCMsBKAA"],[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjd2ovTytKWAxWdjK8BHZjRCb0Q3YcHCMwBKAE"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjd2ovTytKWAxWdjK8BHZjRCb0Q3IcHCMoBKB8",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["丸亀製麵真的是我肚子餓、想吃點熱湯麵時的好朋友！每次來都會被那種日式半自助的氛圍吸引，看著師傅現場揉麵、煮麵，就覺得特別有食慾。它的烏龍麵條一如既往地Q彈滑順，搭配濃郁的湯頭，隨便點一碗都舒服又暖胃，CP值真的沒話說，是很貼近日常的平價好選擇。\n不過，這次來卻踩到了一個大雷！通常我都會夾個幾樣炸物來配，但今天的炸魚青菜真的讓人超級失望。那個炸魚，不知道是不是油沒有瀝乾淨，還是食材不夠新鮮，一咬下去魚腥味超級重，腥到有點難以下嚥，完全蓋過了麵衣的酥脆感。連旁邊的炸青菜吃起來也感覺油耗味重，不太對勁。\n本來想說算了，但這腥味真的太失敗了，害我有點影響到吃麵的好心情。希望丸亀製麵可以注意一下炸物區的品管，尤其是海鮮類，新鮮度真的要顧好啊！下次來我應該只敢點麵了，炸物可能要先pass了。總之，麵是OK的，但今天的炸物真的不行，給個中等評價。",null,[0,122]]]],[null,1760316753000000,1760316753000000,"10 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfLUVVVTlqUDdCTmJUeHdSMFRKcXp1UQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfLUVVVTlqUDdCTmJUeHdSMFRKcXp1URoTQ2d3STBacXh4d1lRdTZudWdnTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjd2ovTytKWAxWdjK8BHZjRCb0Q_2MIzQEoIA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHZW1ScVp6SmtNbVExV2xjeFJtUnJZM3BpYWs1RFdESjNOVkZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHZW1ScVp6SmtNbVExV2xjeFJtUnJZM3BpYWs1RFdESjNOVkZZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHZW1ScVp6SmtNbVExV2xjeFJtUnJZM3BpYWs1RFdESjNOVkZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHZW1ScVp6SmtNbVExV2xjeFJtUnJZM3BpYWs1RFdESjNOVkZZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHZW1ScVp6SmtNbVExV2xjeFJtUnJZM3BpYWs1RFdESjNOVkZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/30544548