以選小辣，我又灑了辣粉、七味粉和白胡椒粉，麵條口感剛好，有彈性，豬肉片無膻味，酸菜有些許香味，不會太鹹，整體是清爽的。\n\n另外，我夾了炸白身魚、炸竹輪、炸秋葵、炸雞(雞腿肉)、炸杏鮑菇，麵衣完全不油膩，而且蠻薄的，所有炸物都好吃，一整個很滿足。",null,[0,38]]]],[null,1760401862000000,1760401862000000,"10 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfdUZkYUZfU01NaG5kNVU4RS0tRzNsZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfdUZkYUZfU01NaG5kNVU4RS0tRzNsZxoTQ2d3SXhyTzJ4d1lRNUlIZXBRTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjd2ovTytKWAxWdjK8BHZjRCb0Q_2MIzwIoCg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTldGRlZrOVRSV1J5VlRGd2RFMXFSblJUYTA1TlZUSXhkVTB5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTldGRlZrOVRSV1J5VlRGd2RFMXFSblJUYTA1TlZUSXhkVTB5WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTldGRlZrOVRSV1J5VlRGd2RFMXFSblJUYTA1TlZUSXhkVTB5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTldGRlZrOVRSV1J5VlRGd2RFMXFSblJUYTA1TlZUSXhkVTB5WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTldGRlZrOVRSV1J5VlRGd2RFMXFSblJUYTA1TlZUSXhkVTB5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3054454803546380982/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTldGRlZrOVRSV1J5VlRGd2RFMXFSblJUYTA1TlZUSXhkVTB5WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您的喜愛，烏龍麵都是門市現場手工擀製，所以才會這麼Q彈喔!!歡迎再次光臨^^",null,[0,40]]]],[null,null,1462,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBNWFFVk9TRWRyVTFwdE1qRnRTa05NVTIxdU0yYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa9da1a49c37061b4!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjA5aEVOSEdrU1ptMjFtSkNMU21uM2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.googl